  "question": {
    "text": "The length of the chord <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math> intercepted by the parabola <math><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is equal to",
