  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Focus of <math><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2,0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;which satisfies the equation <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>.</mo></math><br />Hence, line <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math> is a focal chord.<br />Now, the length of the focal chord equals to <math><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi></math> <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi></mi><mi>&#952;</mi></math> where <math><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>tan</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo></msqrt><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><msup><mn>0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msup></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> length of chord <math><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi></mi><msup><mrow><mn>60</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math><br /> <math><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> units",
